Almost. Pets will step on squares containing cursed objects
"reluctantly", and once on the square, will pick stuff like
chests up. However, the pet picks up whatever is _on top_,
and refuses to pick up cursed objects, so if you drop the
cursed object on top of the chest on top of Elbereth, your
only remaining concern is peaceful monsters, which will
ignore Elbereth and ignore cursed stuff too, plus monsters
that don't respect Elbereth anyway.

